        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 25 at 2:34PM EDT until September 26 at 7:00PM EDT by NWS Wakefield VA</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...North winds 15 to 20 kt with gusts up to 30 kt and
waves 1 to 3 ft.

* WHERE...Rappahannock River from Urbanna to Windmill Point,
York River and James River from Jamestown to the James River
Bridge.

* WHEN...Until 7 PM EDT Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
